error[E0515]: 'level' is write-only outside its class
 --> $DIR/write-only.nra:7:15
  |
4 |         | set: level = value;
  |         --------------------- 'level' declares only a setter
...
7 | let current = sink.level;
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^ cannot read 'level' here
  |
  = note: 'level' has no 'get' accessor, so only code inside 'Sink' can read it
  = help: add a getter to the field, such as '| get: level;'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0515`.
